# Architecture Plan

## Product shape
- Vite + React + TypeScript single-page app for pulley lessons, quizzes, and physics simulations.
- Content-first architecture: lessons are authored as MDX and composed from reusable interactive widgets.
- Simulation-first abstractions: a small physics adapter layer hides Matter.js details from lesson content and UI components.

